SCREEN
ESC: exit help / menus / fullscreen
ALT+ENTER: toggle fullscreen

PRESETS
SPACE / H: hard cut to next preset
BACKSPACE: previous preset
SCROLL LOCK: lock or unlock current preset
R: random or sequential order
L: load specific preset
+ / -: rate current preset

EDITING
M: preset-editing menu
S: save preset
A: random mini-mash-up
D: shader lock mode

PLAYBACK
Z: previous track
X: play
C: pause
V: stop
B: next track
P: show or hide playlist
U / Shift+U: cycle playback order
mouse wheel: volume up or down (if enabled)

DISPLAY
F1: help
F2: song title
F3: song time / length
F4: preset name
F5: frames per second
F6: preset rating
F7 / Y: reload custom messages
F8: jump to presets directory
F9: shader help

SEEK / VOLUME
up / down: volume
left / right: seek 5 seconds
SHIFT + left/right: seek 30 seconds
